                                        "glosses": [
                                            "桃金孃科蒲桃屬植物（Syzygium aromaticum），常綠喬木"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21c9bcf4-f05a-3cb6-986f-a4478ff672d4",
                                        "entry_id": "cb001313-4df1-3741-bbd2-0e53929de2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "上述植物的乾燥花蕾，作為藥材，亦是一種廣泛用於烹飪的香料"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "中醫學"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0b0a2ce-02bb-3d71-9679-5f937de557d0",
                                        "entry_id": "cb001313-4df1-3741-bbd2-0e53929de2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(～屬) 木樨科的一屬落葉灌木或小喬木（Syringa）"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "357f7c37-99ea-34a5-b41f-b2eb0d4a01cd",
                                        "entry_id": "cb001313-4df1-3741-bbd2-0e53929de2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "女子的舌尖"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40d8718a-fa45-4d83-99f1-320f2e5ac986",
                                                "sense_id": "357f7c37-99ea-34a5-b41f-b2eb0d4a01cd",
                                                "text": "曉妝初過，沉檀輕注些兒個，向人微露丁香顆。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "644068d9-ca77-41aa-b9b6-d14bd7cd5e45",
                                                "sense_id": "357f7c37-99ea-34a5-b41f-b2eb0d4a01cd",
                                                "text": "晓妆初过，沉檀轻注些儿个，向人微露丁香颗。"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "783867c8-3c77-3389-a184-74cb0881295e",
                                        "entry_id": "cb001313-4df1-3741-bbd2-0e53929de2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "鈕扣"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94d8a3fe-c1ac-4221-9238-8513d5e9b2e2",
                                                "sense_id": "783867c8-3c77-3389-a184-74cb0881295e",
                                                "text": "兩個在那裡交扣丁香，並照菱花，梳洗才完，穿戴未畢。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec2bf9a2-563c-4708-b65a-d9122f2b4c9b",
                                                "sense_id": "783867c8-3c77-3389-a184-74cb0881295e",
                                                "text": "两个在那里交扣丁香，并照菱花，梳洗才完，穿戴未毕。"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
